Package: maxentcpp
Type: Package
Title: Maximum Entropy Species Distribution Modeling (C++ Implementation)
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-04-18
Authors@R: c(
    person("Angel", "Robles", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "a.l.robles.fernandez@gmail.com"))
Description: C++ implementation of Maximum Entropy (Maxent) species distribution
    modeling with R bindings. This package provides a high-performance implementation
    of the Maxent algorithm for modeling species geographic distributions from
    occurrence data and environmental variables.
